# Graphical boot — the Aegis splash instead of a scrolling console.
# The 0200-plymouth hook registers theme/aegis and rebuilds the initramfs;
# without these packages that hook has nothing to configure and the boot
# falls back to a wall of systemd [OK] lines (seen on the v0.2.0 ISO).
plymouth
plymouth-label
# W14 — two-step.so (the mark splash renderer) ships in the spinner theme
# package, not in plymouth itself; the C renderer family paints on the
# boot-test machine, the script plugin never did.
plymouth-theme-spinner
